{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"content_hash":"9113f6895bb3c1522a19b0a14958f15cd80e1e2e30ceb732f73c30274b98611a","digest":{"component_or_area":"outbound type mapping and inbound recovery","key_entities":["LOCAL_TYPE_TO_JIRA","EXCLUDED_SYNC_TYPES","config.effective_type_map","config.assert_type_decisions_complete","config.effective_excluded_sync_types","config.jira_to_local_type","rebar-type:","outbound_labels._desired_type_annotation","outbound_labels._diff_type_annotation_labels","inbound_fields.recover_type_label","outbound_differ.compute_outbound_mutations","outbound_fields._map_local_to_jira_fields","OutboundMapper.map_local_to_remote","TicketType"],"problem_keywords":["type mapping","config-driven","type skip","lossy round-trip","fail-closed","rebar annotation"],"propositions":["Type decisions (remap, skip, or fail-closed) must be enforced once up-front at compute_outbound_mutations before any mutation is built, guarding all syncable types against undecided mappings via assert_type_decisions_complete.","Per-project skip entries derive from type_map values equal to SKIP sentinel, unioning with built-in EXCLUDED_SYNC_TYPES to form effective_excluded_sync_types keyed by project.","Type mapping must thread through all three OutboundMapper implementations and both field mappers (Cloud, DC) via type_map parameter beside status_map, resolving issuetype with fail-closed behavior replacing coercion.","Lossy type collapse (when forward remap does not reverse to original local type) stamps a symmetric rebar-type: annotation label, requiring jira_to_local_type reverse map for detection.","Type annotation label recovery via recover_type_label mirrors status recovery, restoring lost type information on inbound via reverse map without config state.","rebar-type: prefix must be added to all four internal-label filter tuples across outbound_labels, inbound_collection_diffs, differ, and inbound_translate to prevent spurious sync as user tags."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787565362398043001,"uuid":"5ade6906-10f9-4651-bdeb-eb3d273d09e1"}